      <para unique="1046516">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+166969"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046518">Multiply scalar single-precision floating-point value from xmm1 and xmm3/m32, negate the multiplication result and subtract xmm2 and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046483">EVEX.LLIG.66.0F38.W0 AF /r </para>
      <para unique="1046484">VFNMSUB213SS xmm1 {k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m32{er} </para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046488">B</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046490">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046495">AVX512F</para>
      <para unique="1046496">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+271673"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046498">Multiply scalar single-precision floating-point value from xmm1 and xmm2, negate the multiplication result and subtract xmm3/m32 and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046466">EVEX.LLIG.66.0F38.W0 BF /r </para>
      <para unique="1046467">VFNMSUB231SS xmm1 {k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m32{er}</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046471">B</para>
      </td>
